Z||000033||Lady Pegasus||10-05-2001||12:16 PM||||Well, I love my job.  Yes, it is not the greatest job in the world.  I am a kennel attendant for a veterinary clinic, but I have never been happier at a job.  Sure, the pay is not THE greatest, but when you look forward to going to see all your co-workers, it's great.  Everybody helps everybody out.  We celebrate birthdays, we have a picnic, we go gambling for Christmas (HA!!  GO PONIES!!  MAMA NEEDS A NEW PAIR OF SHOES!!).  But it really is great.  I have worked with animal clinics for over 3 1/2 years now, and hopefully ONE DAY I will get my ass in gear and go to school to be a Veterinary Technician.  That's my goal.  But for now, I scoop poop...and that's o.k.  Because I'm good enough, I'm smart enough, and dog-gone it, people LIKE ME!!<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||4
Z||000034||reddog||10-05-2001||09:19 PM||||Here's one for you spent several years in the Army 25th infantry division scholfeild Barracks Hawaii (Ranger). Then I worked as a Sheriffs Deputy for about 6 years. But now I have the Ultimate fun job as General manager of a night club. This has got to be the best job I ever had plus the pay is much better than police pay. Less stress!!!||||reg||1
Z||000035||artherd||10-06-2001||05:10 AM||||Hey Raydar, you have a "T3 Defender" (nurf gun) on-site on a quick-release, right?!?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Amoung other things (web, gfx, visual effects, digitial video, SGI, etc) I do the play with other people's (and now my, just got an older 7000 cisco to sit on my T1) expensive toys. <P>The carrier class stuff rules (OC-48s and DWDM OC-192 talking to Juniper and GSR stuff, mmmm  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Also playing with wireless ptp and ptmp kit, that's really fun.  Thumbin your nose to the RBOCs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Raydar:<BR><B>I do telecommunications work. Fiber optics, multiplexers, T-1, T-3, yada, yada, yada. It's pretty much like getting paid to play with someone else's expensive toys.<BR>A lot of the time it's pretty boring (hence, my presence here), until something breaks. Then it can rapidly turn to "Panic Mode".<BR>I <I>hate</I> lightning. <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
